// =============================================================================
// tidelink_fpga_v2.flist — S3 PHY-swap build variant (V2) of the FPGA filelist
//
// V2 = the NEW shared GPIO-PHY component (deps/tidelink-phy, the
// silicon-validated FIX-N..R serdes fork + new lane-mask-aware calibrator)
// in place of the V1 local_overrides/tidelink-gpio-phy composition.
// Derived from flists/tidelink_fpga.flist with the SAME swap set as
// flists/tidelink_top_full_asic_v2.flist:
//   1. defines TIDELINK_PHY_V2 (activates the `ifdef arms in the shared RTL:
//      src/rtl/local_overrides/Wlink.v, axi_chiplet_controller.sv and
//      src/rtl/tidelink_top.sv);
//   2. swaps the serdes/deskew/calibrator/checker sources to
//      deps/tidelink-phy/rtl (same module names as V1 — the two trees
//      CANNOT co-compile);
//   3. adds the PHY-owned TX/RX lane front-end blocks the new WavD2DGpio
//      instantiates (tx_segmenter / tx_mask / rx_demask);
//   4. drops src/rtl/tidelink_eye_regs.sv (eye-vis retired in V2, AUDIT #17 —
//      Region 10 APB reads return 0 via the tidelink_top RAZ tie).
//
// The V1 flist (tidelink_fpga.flist) MUST NOT be edited as part of this
// change: with TIDELINK_PHY_V2 undefined every shared-RTL `ifdef arm
// compiles the old code, keeping the default V1 build bit-identical.
//
// SRAM strategy : src/rtl/fifo/fpga/tidelink_sram.sv is a drop-in wrapper
//   around Arm's cmsdk_fpga_sram (BRAM-inferred). Same port signature as
//   the ASIC rf_16k macro — no extra wrapper needed.
// Wlink source  : pre-generated Verilog committed at
//   deps/axi-chiplet-controller/logical/wlink/ (Chisel config:
//   wav.wlink.Wlink8LaneAXI32bitConfig via
//   `make -C deps/axi-chiplet-controller wlink`).
// ASIC-only cells stripped: rf_16k (TSMC 65nm), DFT/scan collateral,
//   ASIC stdcell lib BUFs/clock cells, tidelink_netlist.flist entries.
// Tie-offs / stubs: no separate PUF SRAM — PUF reads share the FIFO SRAM
//   (same tidelink_sram instance inside tidelink_fifo_mem). No scan ports.
// =============================================================================
// Define carried by per-file shims (src/rtl/v2shims/) — NOT a +define+:
// Vivado IP packaging drops fileset defines, synth-run options and global
// includes (all three proven 2026-06-11). VCS compiles the shims directly;
// fpga/filelist.tcl MATERIALISES each shim into a standalone copy under
// imp/fpga/gen_v2/ (full original text + prepended `define) because
// ipx::package_project also drops `include-only shims from the packaged
// file set (fourth mechanism proven dropped, 2026-06-11).
+incdir+${TIDELINK_HOME}/src/rtl/local_overrides

// Prerequisite: source set_env.sh to set TIDELINK_HOME and CMSDK_DIR before
// invoking Vivado or any other tool with this filelist.

+incdir+${TIDELINK_HOME}/src/rtl
+incdir+${TIDELINK_HOME}/src/rtl/fifo
+incdir+${TIDELINK_HOME}/deps/tidelink-phy/rtl

// ── FIFO subsystem — FPGA variant (BRAM-inferred via cmsdk_fpga_sram) ────────
${CMSDK_DIR}/logical/cmsdk_ahb_to_sram/verilog/cmsdk_ahb_to_sram.v
${CMSDK_FPGA_SRAM_V}
${CMSDK_DIR}/logical/cmsdk_ahb_to_apb/verilog/cmsdk_ahb_to_apb.v
${TIDELINK_HOME}/src/rtl/fifo/fpga/tidelink_sram.sv
